`},{type:"paragraph",raw:"Pausing saves the current game in this browser. Use Continue in the main menu to load it.",text:"Pausing saves the current game in this browser. Use Continue in the main menu to load it.",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Pausing saves the current game in this browser. Use Continue in the main menu to load it.",text:"Pausing saves the current game in this browser. Use Continue in the main menu to load it.",escaped:!1}]},{type:"space",raw:`

